  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Indonesian National Police are conducting a comprehensive investigation into the reported illegal wiretapping of President Prabowo Subianto. As part of this process, the Division of Professionalism and Security has commenced ethical hearings involving law enforcement officials and civil servants. This development follows reports of intimidation against six witnesses involved in the case, who have formally requested protection from the Witness and Victim Protection Agency (LPSK). Concurrently, the police leadership has announced organizational personnel rotations to bolster operational performance. Legislative bodies, including the House of Representatives led by Puan Maharani, have publicly urged authorities to handle the inquiry with professional transparency. Various external organizations, including Indonesia Police Watch and academic student bodies, have emphasized that this event should serve as a pivotal moment to strengthen national cyber resilience and institutional accountability within the state apparatus.",
